      "description": "Lake Forest College Employment  | Lake Forest College This website uses cookies so that we can provide you with the best user experience. By using this website, you consent to the use of cookies. Learn more about our use of your data by reading our Privacy Policy. Accept Privacy Policy Apply Visit Campus Request Info Give Students, Faculty, and Staff Search Menu Lake Forest College Employment Offices and Departments / Human Resources / Lake Forest College Employment Join Our Team Belong. Grow. Make an Impact. At Lake Forest College, being a Forester means being part of a close‑knit community that draws strength from diverse identities, experiences, and perspectives. We are deeply connected to one another and united by shared values that shape how we learn, work, and lead. We are committed to fostering an environment where every individual is seen, heard, cared for, and supported—because excellence thrives when people feel valued and empowered. Our long‑standing traditions and forward‑looking vision connect us not only to our campus community, but to a shared future. Whether you are launching your career or bringing your expertise to higher education, Lake Forest College offers the opportunity to work alongside dedicated faculty and staff who are passionate about student success and meaningful collaboration. We are currently transitioning our Applicant Tracking System. The positions listed below do not appear on the Career Center. Beginning August 2026, all future job postings will be added to the Career Center.  Click on the red text titled \"Career Center\" below to access the Career Center. Explore current opportunities and apply today through our Career Center . Faculty Lecturer in Chemistry Human Resources Lake Forest College Employment New Employees Employee Benefits Non-Discrimination Policy Performance Management Recruitment Staff Holidays Contact Information Human Resources North Hall, Middle Campus 847-735-5028 hr@lakeforest.edu HOURS 