      "title": "For Employers",
      "description": "For Employers  | Lake Forest College This website uses cookies so that we can provide you with the best user experience. By using this website, you consent to the use of cookies. Learn more about our use of your data by reading our Privacy Policy. Accept Privacy Policy Apply Visit Campus Request Info Give Students, Faculty, and Staff Search Menu For Employers Careers / Recruiting Resources for Employers Thank you for your interest in recruiting with us! We invite you to review our Recruiting Policies and Procedures and the ways in which employers can connect with our students and alumni: Post a job. All internships, full-time and part-time positions can be posted via our recruiting platform Handshake . We do not directly share part-time household jobs such as childcare and tutoring; however, local community members can access our list of suggested resources for hiring for household positions. Instructions to post your position can be found on our \"Post a Job or Internship\" page. Recruit on campus via an upcoming virtual event. We host our annual Speed Networking event each fall and other industry specific recruiting events throughout the year. Contact us for information about setting up on campus interviews. Create and promote internships: Review important resources and deadlines pertaining to internships at the College. Career Connections Career Pathways Internships The Forester Network Recruiting Resources for Employers Post a Job or Internship Recruiting Policies Recruiting Interns Employer Testimonials Getting Started Success Stories and Outcomes Meet Our Staff Access our Recruiting Guide Learn about our uniquely qualified students, discover our academic programs and Career Pathways, and explore how you can hire a Forester at your organization. Download the Brochure Connect with The Gorter Family Career Advancement Center on Handshake , a modern platform for college recruiting! You can easily create an account, post jobs and internships, and review applicants all on our online portal. Explore Handshake Additional Employer Resources Recruiting Policies Hiring International Students Directions to Campus Institutional Diversity Fast facts about our students Majors and minors at Lake Forest College. Virtual Employer Resources Guide to Hosting a VIRTUAL Internship Hosting VIRTUAL Recruiting Events Helpful Links Employer Resources For Employers Recruiting Policies Post a Job or Internship Recruiting Interns Student Resources For Students Internships Career Resources Handshake for Students About Our Office Meet Our Team Explore Career Pathways Success Stories and Outcomes Show more + Show less - Employer Resources For Employers Recruiting Policies Post a Job or Internship Recruiting Interns Student Resources For Students Internships Career Resources Handshake for Students About Our Office Meet Our Team Explore Career Pathways Success Stories and Outcomes Contact Information Gorter Family Career Advancement Center 256 Brown Hall, Middle Campus 847-735-5235 careers@lakeforest.edu Hours Academic Year: Monday–Friday, 8:30 a.m. to 5 p.m. Follow Us! 555 North Sheridan Road Lake Forest, Illinois 60045 847-234-3100 Admissions: 847-735-5000 Apply Visit Campus Request Information Conference and Event Services Accessibility Services Campus Map College Catalog Consumer Information Emergency Information Non-Discrimination Policy Privacy © 2026 Lake Forest College Accessibility Services Campus Map College Catalog Consumer Information Emergency Information Non-Discrimination Policy Apply Visit Campus Request Info Give About Us Academics Admissions Alumni Athletics Calendar of Events Careers Chicago Community Giving News and Events Offices and Departments Parents Student Life Students, Faculty, and Staff Students, Faculty, and Staff my.lakeforest Quicklinks College Catalog Commencement Faculty & Staff Directory Students, Faculty, and Staff Canvas my.lakeforest my.involvement Webmail Quicklinks Conference and Event Service