sses Community VITA Tax Program Taxpayer Information Volunteer Information FAQ Giving Spike Initiative Gummere Fellows Gummere Fellows Alumni Offices and Departments Human Resources Lake Forest College Employment New Employees Employee Benefits Non-Discrimination Policy Performance Management Performance Management Recordings Recruitment Recruitment Training Materials Staff Holidays Offices and Departments Communications and Marketing Hometown News Releases The Lake Forest College Brand College Style Guide College Logos News Stories and Media Relations Event Step-by-Step Guide External Speaker Guidelines Design Services Photography Requests Website Support Website Update Request Form Standard Page Layout Example Social Media Guidelines Offices and Departments Groner Foundation Programs Grant Eligibility & Guidelines Testimonials Offices and Departments Public Safety SafeForesters App Daily Crime Log Emergency Numbers Parking Parking Registration and Payment Campus Parking Policy Ticket Appeal Process Emergency and Safety Response Plans Crime Prevention Annual Security and Fire Safety Report Reporting a Crime Anonymous Witness Submissions Additional Resources Campus Escorts Offices and Departments Registrar Academic Calendars Contact Us Course Registration Grading Information Graduation Requirements Transcripts, Diplomas, and Verification Letters Transfer, AP, and IB Credit College Catalog Family Educational Rights and Privacy Act (FERPA) Offices and Departments Facilities Management Submit a Work Order Fleet Vehicle Reservations Residence Hall Floor Plans Faculty Housing Lost Key Charges Meet Our Staff Offices and Departments Mailing Services Domestic Services International Services Inter-Office Services Offices and Departments Business Office Student Accounts Billing and Payment Student Health Insurance Plan Refunds Financial Policies 1098T Tax Information 2026-2027 Tuition and Fees 2025-2026 Tuition and Fees Cashier Accounts Payable Payroll Student Payroll Account